.env
.env.charon.more
docker-compose.override.yml
charon-enr-private-key
validator_keys/
keystore-*
deposit-data.json
cluster-definition.json
cluster-lock.json
.DS_Store
data/
.idea
.charon
# Configs that older releases rendered here; they are now rendered inside the containers.
prometheus/prometheus.yml
alloy/config.alloy
commit-boost/config.toml

# Cluster data and keys
**/canary-*/
**/node[0-9]*/
**/cluster-lock.json
**/validator_keys/
**/keystore-*.json
**/keystore-*.txt
